            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 145312,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Podemos usar comparações para verificar coisas em um jogo, como se um jogador tem menos saúde ou mais pontos do que outra coisa.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 145313,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para verificar se um valor é menor que outro, usamos o <strong>operador de menor que</strong>, <code>&lt;</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"26\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerHealth &lt; \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>&lt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 145314,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Se o valor à esquerda for menor que o valor à direita, como em <code>1 &lt; 235</code>, o resultado é <code>true</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"19\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" &lt; \" /><text value=\"235\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>1</code> seguido de <code>&lt;</code> e finalmente <code>235</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 145315,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Se o valor à esquerda não for menor que o valor à direita, como em <code>235 &lt; 1</code>, o resultado é <code>false</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"19\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"235\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" &lt; \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>&lt;</code> seguido de <code>1</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 145316,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para verificar se um valor é maior que outro, usamos o <strong>operador maior que</strong>, <code>&gt;</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"19\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(score &gt; \" /><text value=\"90\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>&gt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
