        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 145325,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para verificar se a saúde de um jogador é menor ou igual a um número, usamos o <strong>operador menor ou igual a</strong>, <code>&lt;=</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"16\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" &lt;= \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>&lt;=</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 145326,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Se o número à esquerda for menor ou igual ao número à direita, como em <code>11 &lt;= 11</code>, o resultado é <code>true</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"20\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" &lt;= \" /><text value=\"11\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>11</code> seguido de <code>&lt;=</code> e finalmente <code>11</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 145327,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para verificar se uma pontuação é maior ou igual a outro número, usamos o <strong>operador maior ou igual a</strong>, <code>&gt;=</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"19\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"3099\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" &gt;= \" /><text value=\"3099\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>&gt;=</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 145328,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para armazenar o resultado de uma comparação em uma variável, usamos o sinal <code>=</code>. Este é o <strong>operador de atribuição</strong>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"14\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" &lt;= \" /><text value=\"15\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>=</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 145329,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Também podemos usar um operador de comparação para comparar uma variável com outra variável, como em <code>min &lt;= max</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"===\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"56\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" min = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" max = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = min &lt;= max;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>min</code> seguido de <code>&lt;=</code> e finalmente <code>max</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 145330,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual operador verifica se um valor é menor ou igual a outro valor?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item correct=\"true\" value=\"1\"><code>&lt;=</code></item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\"><code>&gt;=</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>&lt;=</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
