            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Verifique se <code>enemiesDefeated</code> é menor ou igual a <code>minimumNeeded</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&gt;=\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"77\" endIndex=\"92\" /><option startIndex=\"93\" endIndex=\"95\" /><option startIndex=\"96\" endIndex=\"109\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemiesDefeated = \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" minimumNeeded = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" didNotMeetGoal = enemiesDefeated &lt;= minimumNeeded;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(didNotMeetGoal);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>enemiesDefeated</code> seguido de <code>&lt;=</code> e finalmente <code>minimumNeeded</code>.</p></body></html>"
